  "body": "_This is a proposal for sharing and composing functionalities across connectors._\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n\r\nThe logic for our \"show more\" feature is kind of all over the place and is part of the connector logic itself:\r\n\r\n- Binds `toggleShowMore` to get a single function reference\r\n- Takes care of keeping track of the `isShowingMore` state\r\n- Pollutes the widget scope: `isShowingMore`, `toggleShowMore`, `cachedToggleShowMore`, `createToggleShowMore`, `getLimit` ([see source](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/blob/531bbe883ab956063db6d7af59840b92addb8fff/src/connectors/hierarchical-menu/connectHierarchicalMenu.js#L98-L116))\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/blob/531bbe883ab956063db6d7af59840b92addb8fff/src/connectors/hierarchical-menu/connectHierarchicalMenu.js#L98-L116\r\n\r\nThis PR introduces a new pattern for subscribing a widget to a \"show more\" behavior with a dedicated logic.\r\n\r\nThis refactors the usage in:\r\n\r\n- `connectRefinementList`\r\n- `connectMenu`\r\n- `connectHierarchicalMenu`\r\n\r\n## Usage\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nfunction connectHierarchicalMenu(render, unmount) {\r\n  // Instantiate the higher-order function\r\n  const withShowMore = createWithShowMore();\r\n\r\n  return widgetParams => {\r\n    // ...\r\n\r\n    return withShowMore(\r\n      ({ toggleShowMore, isShowingMore, onToggleShowMore }) => ({\r\n        // ...\r\n\r\n        render(renderProps) {\r\n          onToggleShowMore(this.render.bind(this, renderProps));\r\n\r\n          // ...\r\n        },\r\n      })\r\n    );\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Alternative names\r\n\r\nThe current working name of this category of features is `enhancers`.\r\n\r\nOther names I have in mind:\r\n\r\n- `wrappers`\r\n- `hofs` (higher-order functions)\r\n\r\nFeel free to suggest some more.\r\n\r\n## Next steps\r\n\r\nIf you'd like to use this pattern in our codebase, it can be composed with other enhancers like `withSearchForFacetValues`:\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nfunction connectHierarchicalMenu(render, unmount) {\r\n  // Instantiate the higher-order function\r\n  const withShowMore = createWithShowMore();\r\n  const withSearchForFacetValues = createWithSearchForFacetValues();\r\n\r\n  return widgetParams => {\r\n    // ...\r\n\r\n    return withSearchForFacetValues(\r\n      ({ searchForFacetValues, onSearchForFacetValues }) =>\r\n        withShowMore(({ toggleShowMore, isShowingMore, onToggleShowMore }) => ({\r\n          // Widget definition\r\n        }))\r\n    );\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n```\r\n",
